\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Spec: "Playlist Roulette" \'97 Spotify Guessing Game\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\fs36 \cf0 1. Concept\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Two players face off using each other's Spotify playlists. On your turn, your opponent picks a song from 
\f2\i your own
\f1\i0  playlist, and you have to guess it from short audio snippets \'97 starting at 0.1 seconds and growing longer each time you fail. The less audio you need, the more points you score.\
Think Heardle, but the songs are picked by a real person who knows exactly which deep cut will stump you.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \strokec3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

